{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. [[cite:obs-55f345dd82dc0a69957793d2602caee070e3f0c1 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.\n\nThe procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR. [[cite:obs-191020828576f0c9c71183233dac4a718173013b \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"8d07a5c6ace44eef23c8280dc7333792f980c8e8ce718a47376785505b32009c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Added the single-signature purchase limit from the CFO directive and procurement policy, clarifying that the directive takes precedence where they differ, with exact source citations."}